      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two-Pointer Algorithm:\n1. Start i at beginning, j at end\n2. Skip non-alphanumeric characters\n3. Compare lowercase versions:\n   'A' vs 'a' → match (case-insensitive)\n   Move both pointers inward\n4. If mismatch → return false\n5. If pointers meet → return true",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
